 hidden. The dropdown closes.\n    34→\n    35→#### Test: TripTypeSelector selects \"Multi-city\" option\n    36→- **Components**: TripTypeSelector\n    37→- **Initial state**: Search page loaded with \"Round trip\" selected\n    38→- **Action**: User clicks the trip type selector and selects \"Multi-city\"\n...\n</persisted-output>"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XZjBU1SyuTCDCHirhs7rFj","session_id":"9e80d9ed-4a01-4828-8be0-6ab5ca64d88a","uuid":"b3ca1533-5e72-499f-b568-eeadbefbed04"}
